{"t":"TGT","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Target Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Discount Stores","employees":400000,"hq":"Minneapolis, MN, United States","website":"https://corporate.target.com","summary_en":"Target Corporation operates as a general merchandise retailer in the United States. It offers apparel for women, men, young adults, kids, toddlers, and babies, as well as jewelry, accessories, and shoes; and beauty products, such as skin and bath care, cosmetics, hair care, oral care, deodorant, and shaving products. The company also provides food and beverage products comprising dry and perishable grocery, including snacks, candy, beverages, deli, bakery, meat, produce, and food service; electronics which includes video games and consoles, toys, sporting goods, entertainment, and luggage; bed and bath, home décor, school/office supplies, storage, small appliances, kitchenware, greeting cards, party supplies, furniture, lighting, home improvement, and seasonal merchandise; and household essentials, such as household cleaning, paper products, over-the-counter healthcare, vitamins and supplements, baby gear, and pet supplies. In addition, it sells merchandise through periodic design and creative partnerships, and shop-in-shop experience; and in-store amenities. The company sells its products through its stores; and digital channels, including Target.com. Target Corporation was incorporated in 1902 and is headquartered in Minneapolis, Minnesota.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Target Corporation은 미국에서 일반 상품 소매업체로 운영되고 있습니다. 여성, 남성, 청소년, 아동, 유아, 유아용 의류는 물론 보석, 액세서리, 신발도 제공합니다. 피부 및 목욕 케어, 화장품, 헤어 케어, 구강 케어, 탈취제 및 면도 제품과 같은 미용 제품. 이 회사는 또한 스낵, 사탕, 음료, 델리, 베이커리, 육류, 농산물 및 식품 서비스를 포함하여 건조하고 부패하기 쉬운 식료품으로 구성된 식품 및 음료 제품을 제공합니다. 비디오 게임 및 콘솔, 장난감, 스포츠 용품, 엔터테인먼트 및 수하물을 포함하는 전자 제품; 침대 및 욕실, 가정 장식, 학교/사무용품, 보관함, 소형 가전제품, 주방용품, 축하 카드, 파티 용품, 가구, 조명, 주택 개조 및 계절 상품; 가정용 청소용품, 종이 제품, 일반의약품, 비타민 및 보충제, 유아용품, 애완동물 용품 등 가정 필수품도 포함됩니다. 또한 주기적인 디자인과 창의적인 파트너십, Shop-in-Shop 경험을 통해 상품을 판매하고 있습니다. 그리고 매장 내 편의시설. 회사는 매장을 통해 제품을 판매합니다. Target.com을 포함한 디지털 채널. Target Corporation은 1902년에 설립되었으며 미네소타 주 미니애폴리스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":157.95,"mcap":71756169216.0,"pe":16.401869,"fpe":16.547497,"peg":2.232,"ps":0.6662288,"pb":4.021437,"ev_ebitda":9.955,"div":2.94,"beta":0.932,"hi52":170.75,"lo52":83.44},"fin":{"rev":107704999936.0,"rev_g":0.053,"eps_g":1.005,"gross":0.2838,"op":0.06044,"net":0.04078,"roe":0.26408002,"fcf":3432999936.0,"cash":5410999808.0,"debt":19196000256.0,"de":107.583,"eps":9.63,"feps":9.54525},"own":{"short":0.0374,"inst":0.89725,"insider":0.00269},"analyst":{"n":34,"mean":163.35294,"median":160.5,"high":190.0,"low":128.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.47368,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":11,"hold":21,"sell":0,"strongSell":4},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":11,"hold":21,"sell":0,"strongSell":4},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":10,"hold":22,"sell":0,"strongSell":4}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-13","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"In-Line","FromGrade":"In-Line","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":165.0,"priorPriceTarget":170.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-30","Firm":"HSBC","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":190.0,"priorPriceTarget":125.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-20","Firm":"Telsey Advisory Group","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":182.0,"priorPriceTarget":170.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-20","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":160.0,"priorPriceTarget":148.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-20","Firm":"Goldman Sachs","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":161.0,"priorPriceTarget":127.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-20","Firm":"BMO Capita